# Pinned sky130 PDK revision for this repository.
#
# This hash is the open_pdks/sky130 commit that LibreLane 3.0.11 itself pins
# in its own `librelane/pdk_hashes.yaml`, so the PDK here and the PDK upstream
# tests against are the same revision. Sources:
#   https://github.com/librelane/librelane/blob/3.0.11/librelane/pdk_hashes.yaml
#   https://github.com/efabless/volare/releases (tag sky130-<this hash>)
#
# Enable it with:
#   export PDK_ROOT="$PWD/.ciel"
#   ciel enable --pdk sky130 --pdk-root "$PDK_ROOT" 8afc8346a57fe1ab7934ba5a6056ea8b43078e71
#
# `flow/run.py` does this for you and records the result in the run manifest.
# Do not edit this file casually: changing the PDK revision changes every
# metric the extractor reports, and therefore every episode's post_state.

8afc8346a57fe1ab7934ba5a6056ea8b43078e71
